Several plugins are modified versions of plugins from IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition
(https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community), Copyright (C) JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; each such plugin's README names the plugin it is based on.
Plugins based on IntelliJ Community code were modified by Phantom contributors: each changed file keeps its original
copyright header, if it has one, and carries the line "Modified by Phantom contributors" below it (or as its first line),
and the changes are recorded in this repository's Git history.
The Gradle plugin (gradle-core/) packs the Gradle API and Tooling API (gradle-api-9.6.0.jar, JetBrains' repackaging
published as org.jetbrains.intellij.deps:gradle-api) of Gradle (https://gradle.org), Copyright Gradle, Inc. and contributors, under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The Gradle for Java plugin (gradle-java/) packs Apache Ant 1.10.15 (https://ant.apache.org)
in gradle-jps.jar, under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with Ant's NOTICE in that jar.
The Gradle DSL plugin (gradle-dsl/) is based on code of the Android Open Source Project
(https://source.android.com/), Copyright (C) The Android Open Source Project, under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The TOML plugin (toml/) includes code from the intellij-rust project under the MIT License (toml/LICENSE).
The Terminal plugin (terminal/) includes command specs generated from the Fig autocomplete specs
(https://github.com/withfig/autocomplete), Copyright (c) 2021 Hercules Labs Inc. (Fig), under the MIT License
(terminal/LICENSE).
The Icon Pack plugin (icons/) includes icons of Material Icon Theme (https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme),
Copyright (c) 2021 Philipp Kief, under the MIT License (icons/src/main/resources/icons/material/LICENSE.md).
The TextMate Bundles plugin (textmate/) includes the TextMate grammars of Visual Studio Code's built-in extensions,
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, under the MIT License, HashiCorp's HCL and Terraform grammars under the Mozilla
Public License 2.0, and other grammars under their own licenses (textmate/LICENSE).
The Mermaid plugin (mermaid/) includes mermaid.js, a bundle of mermaid (MIT) and the npm packages it uses: d3 (ISC,
BSD-3-Clause), cytoscape, dagre-d3-es, KaTeX, lodash-es, marked, roughjs, uuid and others (MIT), DOMPurify
(MPL-2.0 or Apache-2.0) and Font Awesome Free (icons CC BY 4.0, fonts SIL OFL 1.1, code MIT); each with its license
in mermaid.js.LICENSE.txt next to mermaid.js.
The AI Integration plugin (ai-integrations/) includes code ported from Orca (https://github.com/stablyai/orca),
Copyright (c) 2026 Lovecast Inc., under the MIT License (ai-integrations/LICENSE); xterm.js
(https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js), Copyright (c) 2017-2019 The xterm.js authors and others, under the MIT
License (its LICENSE next to it in remote-web/vendor/xterm); and QR Code generator (https://github.com/nayuki/QR-Code-generator),
Copyright (c) Project Nayuki, under the MIT License.

The Java Decompiler plugin (decompiler/) includes Fernflower, Copyright 2014-2025 JetBrains s.r.o. (decompiler/NOTICE.txt).
The Groovy plugin (groovy/) ships the Groovy HotSwap agent, which contains ASM 3.x, Copyright (c) 2000-2007 INRIA,
France Telecom, under a BSD license (groovy/NOTICE).
Phantom Grammar (grammar/) ships English dictionaries built from SCOWL and other word lists, whose copyright notices
and terms are in grammar/NOTICE.
A plugin folder's own NOTICE is packaged as META-INF/NOTICE-<plugin> in the plugin's main jar.

Third-party libraries packaged in a plugin (the jars in its lib/ folder) are listed in META-INF/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
inside the plugin's main jar, each with its Maven coordinates, project page, the license its POM names and the
license and notice files it carries; the texts of those licenses other than Apache 2.0 are in META-INF/licenses/ of the
same jar (generated by the build, buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/ThirdPartyNotices.kt; the texts are in licenses/).

Source code of GPL, LGPL, MPL and EPL licensed components
---------------------------------------------------------
Phantom Grammar (grammar/) packages these libraries under the GNU Lesser General Public License:
- LanguageTool core and English, 6.8.27 (org.jetbrains.intellij.deps.languagetool:languagetool-core, language-en;
  LGPL 2.1), JetBrains' build of LanguageTool: https://github.com/JetBrains/languagetool
- english-pos-dict 0.6 (org.languagetool:english-pos-dict; LGPL 2.1), compiled dictionaries built from the word lists
